{
  "description": "OpenShell sandbox policy plus a grant to Tenzro Terms. Terms are held by Tenzro, approved by the controller's passkey: the policy's tenzro network middleware takes no config and only routes traffic through the extensions. The grant names the models, limits, rails, payees and services; each payment service must be an endpoint of the policy's network_policies. Every sandbox may be created and reach its endpoints (sandbox, fetch); policy changes, MCP tool calls, inference and payments are granted explicitly.",
